has lifelike animations and smart AI that can chase, attack, and corner you.\n\nArm yourself with a powerful MP5, shotgun, handgun, bow & arrow, or sword and choose your combat style. Go loud in intense firefights, pick off enemies from a distance, or take the close-range path and slash through the danger with a sword. With survival tension, free-hunt exploration, and nonstop dinosaur action, every session feels different.\n\nBuilt for Meta Quest, the game features immersive 3D sound, detailed environments, intuitive VR controls, and optimized performance for a smooth headset experience.", "short_description": "Enter a thrilling prehistoric VR survival hunt where every encounter can turn deadly. Fight 9 dinosaur species, including T-Rex and raptors, using MP5, shotgun, handgun, bow & arrow, or sword. Explore a dense jungle, survive intense close-range combat, and enjoy realistic graphics, immersive 3D audio, and smooth Meta Quest controls."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ab Dur Rehman", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "i